[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5026907920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121574#issuecomment-5026907920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121574","id":5026907920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK6CHEA","user":{"login":"NoNormalDev","id":190293561,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1emOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190293561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev","html_url":"https://github.com/NoNormalDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoNormalDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T20:22:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T20:22:02Z","body":"I've also experienced this on Android without adding a plugin dock.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5026907920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5034535299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121574#issuecomment-5034535299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121574","id":5034535299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLBTpgw","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T13:18:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T13:18:02Z","body":"It is intentional that hidden tabs are accounted for so that docks doesn't change size when changing tabs.\nIf the minimum size of the plugin is so big that it causes issues, then it should be made smaller.\n\nChanging the docks to not use hidden tabs won't fix the issue when the plugin is open after all.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5034535299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5053652702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121574#issuecomment-5053652702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121574","id":5053652702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLTie3g","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T02:29:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T02:29:03Z","body":"Even without specifying `custom_minimum_size`, the height increases and hides the dock if the following conditions are met.\n\n1. the dock is added with `add_control_to_dock()`\n2. its tab has **never been opened** (the default state right after adding it; Scene stays selected in the top-left slot)\n3. the dock contains a control whose **minimum height is derived from its own width**:\n   * a `Label` with `autowrap_mode` enabled and text long enough to wrap\n   * a `RichTextLabel` with `fit_content = true` and multi-line text\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\nvar _dock: Control\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n\t_dock = VBoxContainer.new()\n\t_dock.name = \"Emergent Dock\"\n\n\tvar label := Label.new()\n\tlabel.text = \"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\"\n\tlabel.autowrap_mode = TextServer.AUTOWRAP_WORD_SMART\n\t_dock.add_child(label)\n\n\tvar rich := RichTextLabel.new()\n\trich.fit_content = true\n\trich.text = \"bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb\"\n\t_dock.add_child(rich)\n\n\tadd_control_to_dock(EditorPlugin.DOCK_SLOT_LEFT_UR, _dock)\n\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n\tif _dock:\n\t\tremove_control_from_docks(_dock)\n\t\t_dock.free()\n\t\t_dock = null\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5053652702/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5064215142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121574#issuecomment-5064215142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121574","id":5064215142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLdnKZg","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T22:37:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T22:40:58Z","body":"Your Label and RichTextLabel need a minimum or maximum size. There is a note on the `autowrap_mode` properties documentation, or if you make the label in the editor there is even a warning:\n\n<img width=\"876\" height=\"87\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c85fd5b4-6c55-4d10-a12f-7326c79d9598\" />\n\nRelated:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/83546\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102096\n\nThis happens even without docks, if the user has a TabContainer with `use_hidden_tabs_for_min_size` enabled. It should not be fixed on the editor side.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5064215142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]